    <string name="page_one_title">Welcome to My_Land – Your Outing Companion</string>
    <string name="page_one_topic">My_Land is designed to make going out and exploring easy. Discover new places, find activities, and plan your adventures all in one place.</string>
    <string name="page_two_title">Simplify Your Outings with My_Land</string>
    <string name="page_two_topic">Struggling to plan an outing? My_Land makes it easy by offering personalized suggestions for activities and locations that fit your interests.</string>
    <string name="page_three_title">Discover New Places with Swipy</string>
    <string name="page_three_topic">Our new Swipy feature curates hidden spots and local favorites for you to explore. Simply swipe to discover a new place to visit!</string>
    <string name="page_four_title">Navigate Easily with the Interactive Map</string>
    <string name="page_four_topic">With the map, you can view nearby activities and events and find your way to exciting spots effortlessly.</string>
    <string name="page_five_title">Start Your Adventure with Swipy – Share My_Land!</string>
    <string name="page_five_topic">Begin your journey with Swipy and invite friends to join the fun. Discover, explore, and share the My_Land experience together!</string>

